  "body": "A diff that touches only `assets/posts/*.cps` or `assets/machines/*.mch` selects nothing in `cargo xtask gate quick` (found by the #919 research): the plan in `xtask/src/quick.rs` / `plan.rs` maps source modules and test files, not assets. Post scripts decide the posted G-code, so such a change must run the suites that post through that script.\n\nDone means: a diff touching only a post script or a machine file selects the suites whose Gate map names that asset (or, where no map names it, every suite that posts through it); a new asset with no suite is reported by the plan rather than silently skipped; pinned by xtask unit tests.\n\nLists, counts and evidence: the research comment on #919 (https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/919#issuecomment-6808141599).\n\nPart of #919.\n",
